---
title: "syncDiscordNickname (stem-system members.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_env: apiUrl = env.STEM_BOT_API_URL, token = env.BEARER_TOKEN
    q_env --> q_check_env: apiUrl and token defined?
    q_check_env --> q_skip: !apiUrl or !token
    q_skip --> [*]: return (skip sync)
    q_check_env --> q_fetch: apiUrl and token defined
    q_fetch --> q_post: fetch POST /api/nickname/update with discord_uid and name
    q_post --> q_check_res: response received
    q_check_res --> q_error_res: !res.ok
    q_error_res --> [*]: console.error (non-throwing)
    q_check_res --> [*]: res.ok (log success)
    q_post --> q_catch: fetch throws exception
    q_catch --> [*]: console.error (non-throwing)

    note right of q_check_env
        INV-001: Missing env vars cause silent skip, not error
    end note

    note right of q_post
        INV-002: Nickname update body contains discord_uid and name
        INV-003: API failures are logged but never propagated
    end note
